<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="余烬试炼：原创斜视角单人战斗 Demo。可选右键移动或 WASD 移动，鼠标瞄准，双地图试炼与联动印记。">
  <title>余烬试炼 · Project Ember</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%= cssUrl %>">
  <link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>
  <div id="GameDiv" cc_exact_fit_screen="false">
    <div id="Cocos3dGameContainer">
      <canvas id="GameCanvas" width="1280" height="720" tabindex="0" aria-label="余烬试炼。首页可选地图和主技能，首页和暂停菜单可选右键移动或 WASD 移动。WASD 模式左键普攻，右键或 Q 主技能，空格护盾，E 冲刺，R 爆发。Escape 暂停，Enter 开始。"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
